{"ID":"20240513083003-da1d6nk","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083003-da1d6nk","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083003-da1d6nk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172905-rrk8187\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172905-rrk8187\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:500,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172905-rrk8187\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:649,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:656\u0026#125;","title":"320","type":"doc","updated":"20240515104202"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513172905-rrk8187","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 906px;","id":"20240513172905-rrk8187","updated":"20240515104202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"231-1 R, Y"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"34歲，肥胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5/7/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：\n(1)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C型肝炎。2002年作過肝病理切片 (Biopsy)。吃【interferon】干擾素期間，造成右眼失明。故停藥。後又復明。2008年又作切片 (Biopsy)，被稱為C型肝炎第2期。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→肝開竅於眼，吃interferon干擾素傷到肝臟，故眼睛暫時失明。不吃之後又復明。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"(2)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃多種維他命"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 囑不能吃精製糖，巧克力。只可喝白開水或喝 Green tea，因為精製過食物，體積變小，容易累積細胞中，造成細胞負擔，形成陰積。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"睡眠:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 每晚醒來4 次，因為夜尿。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大便 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日行二次 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小便 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃，（因吃維他命。）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃口 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"口渴 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有，喜冷飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手腳 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"溫暖。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"身體:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多時溫熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"流汗:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"容易。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"緩有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃紅乾→熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝區:有破洞→肝積毒素。形成圈紋有脂肪肝→肝積肥氣。 腎區:瞳孔反應慢→腎陽不足。 心區:心區扁平蒼白→心血不足，心陽不足。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、觸診 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手背涼手掌溫，手指尖涼→手指尖是陰陽交界點，此病人沒有陰陽分隔。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝區損傷重。脂肪肝。腎陽不足。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石膏四兩、知母五錢 防己五錢 茯苓五錢 澤瀉六錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→倪師常用的減肥方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天花五錢 生地三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→補陰。天花滋肺陰，生地補肺陰。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢 玉金五錢 龍膽草三錢 黃芩三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→疏肝解鬱，清肝脂肪之肝毒素。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"烏藥四錢 細辛二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→溫下焦，補腎陽，治頻尿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川芎三錢 白芍五錢 茜草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治肝活血化瘀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（1. 白芍味酸入肝，又酸收為治肝活血化瘀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（2. 一般治療肝癌會用到茜草及炙鱉甲，炙鱉甲破血能力很強，會把陰實打開。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（3. 而此病人只是肝炎加上biopsy切片造成scar formation疤痕組織，單用茜草即可黃連二錢  黃芩三錢  梔子三錢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"十付  "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗水煮三碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}